 €2614 Nijmegen ⏰ 40 uur Fulltime Logistiek English Speaking Logistics Employee 
 Afwisselende baan Werken in een hecht team Prettige werkplek 
 Over de functie 
Do you have experience in logistics? And do you prefer to work day shifts? Then this position is perfect for you! 
As a logistics employee, you'll be handling and moving goods on a daily basis. You'll pick orders, check inventory, and ensure that products are properly prepared for shipment. You'll also monitor product quality and, if you have the necessary certifications, operate a forklift and/or reach truck. Your responsibilities will include: 
· Picking orders using a handheld scanner; 
· Checking and maintaining inventory levels; 
· Conducting quality checks on incoming and outgoing products; 
· Moving goods with a forklift and/or reach truck (if certified). 
You'll work Monday through Friday on the day shift from 8:00 to 17:00. 
 Jouw nieuwe werkplek 
You'll be working for a logistics company in the Nijmegen area that has specialized in the storage and distribution of excavator parts for many years. The warehouse has a casual work atmosphere where colleagues enjoy working together and support one another. In addition to work, there's also a focus on socializing. For example, activities such as barbecues and team outings are organized regularly. 
The location is easily accessible from Nijmegen, Wijchen, Beuningen, and Arnhem. 
 Dit bieden wij jou 
· A gross monthly salary of €2.614 based on full-time employment; 
· The prospect of a permanent contract with the employer; 
· 25 vacation days; 
· 8.33% vacation pay; 
· Travel allowance of €0.23 per kilometer; 
· Pension contributions starting on your first day of work; 
· Opportunities for personal development and career advancement. 
 Dit vragen wij van jou 
· You have experience as a logistics employee; 
· A valid forklift and/or reach truck certification is a plus. 
